#: ../../library/ubluepy.rst:82
msgid "Construct a 16- or 128-bit Bluetooth UUID."
msgstr "Constrói um UUID Bluetooth de 16 ou 128 bits."

#: ../../library/ubluepy.rst:84
msgid "``value``"
msgstr "``value``"

#: ../../library/ubluepy.rst:85
msgid "One of:"
msgstr "Um dos seguintes:"

#: ../../library/ubluepy.rst:87
msgid "``int`` --- a 16-bit numeric UUID (``UUID(0x180A)``)."
msgstr "``int`` --- um UUID numérico de 16 bits (\\ ``UUID(0x180A)``\\ )."

#: ../../library/ubluepy.rst:88
msgid ""
"6-character ``\"0xXXXX\"`` string --- a 16-bit UUID, e.g. "
"``UUID(\"0x181A\")``."
msgstr ""
"Cadeia de caracteres ``\"0xXXXX\"`` de 6 caracteres --- um UUID de 16 bits, "
"por exemplo ``UUID(\"0x181A\")``\\ ."

#: ../../library/ubluepy.rst:90
msgid ""
"36-character ``\"xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx\"`` string --- a full "
"128-bit UUID. The vendor-specific portion is registered with the SoftDevice "
"on construction."
msgstr ""
"Cadeia de caracteres ``\"xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx\"`` de 36 "
"caracteres --- um UUID completo de 128 bits. A parte específica do "
"fornecedor é registada no SoftDevice na construção."

#: ../../library/ubluepy.rst:93
msgid "Another :class:`UUID` instance --- performs a copy."
msgstr "Outra instância de :class:`UUID` --- efetua uma cópia."

#: ../../library/ubluepy.rst:95
msgid "Any other length raises ``ValueError(\"Invalid UUID string length\")``."
msgstr ""
"Qualquer outro comprimento lança ``ValueError(\"Invalid UUID string "
"length\")``\\ ."

#: ../../library/ubluepy.rst:100
msgid ""
"Return the low 16 bits of the UUID as an ``int``. For 128-bit UUIDs only the"
" 16-bit field embedded inside the vendor-specific UUID is returned (the full"
" 128-bit value is accessible only via the SoftDevice's vendor-specific "
"index)."
msgstr ""
"Devolve os 16 bits inferiores do UUID como um ``int``\\ . Para UUIDs de 128 "
"bits, é devolvido apenas o campo de 16 bits incorporado no UUID específico "
"do fornecedor (o valor completo de 128 bits é acessível apenas através do "
"índice específico do fornecedor do SoftDevice)."

